{"study_accession":"PRJNA779706","secondary_study_accession":"SRP345641","title":"Next Generation Sequencing Facilitates Quantitative Analysis of Transcriptomes and TCR repertoire in vaccinated PBMCs and tumors","description":"In the clinical trial, we evaluated the immunological efficacy of the vaccination of GBM6-AD, a tumor-cell lysate, assisted with poly-ICLC in low grade glioma. To characterize the gene expression, subset proportions, and T-cell receptor (TCR) profile of T-cells in PBMCs, we analyzed pre- and post-neoadjuvant vaccinated PBMCs from four immunological responders (103-018, -26, -29, -51), using droplet-based 5’ single-cell RNA-sequencing (scRNA-seq) and single-cell T-cell receptor-sequencing (scTCR-seq) with 10x GENOMICS platform. Further, we analyzed the gene expression profiles in resected tumor specimens by bulk RNA-seq analyses. Overall design: Pre- and post-neoadjuvant vaccinated PBMCs from four immunological responders (103-018, -26, -29, -51), those were identified by mass cytometric analyses, were analyzed by scRNA-seq analyses. All of the available resected tumor specimens from both Arm 1 (neoadjuvant vaccination) and Arm 2 (control) were analyzed by bulk RNA-seq analyses","pubmed":"34882581","geo_series":"","n_samples":23,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN23070906","study_accession":"PRJNA779706","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"103_018_screening","description":"103_018_screening","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5686902","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":8,"first_public":"2022-02-03","attributes":[["source_name","PBMCs"],["modality","single cell RNA sequencing"],["patient","103-018"],["cell_type","PBMCs"],["treatment","Pre vaccine"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR16919612","experiment_accession":"SRX13111853","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":141613077,"base_count":42483923100,"first_public":"2022-02-03","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 se